<section id="why">
  <div class="section-eyebrow reveal">Why Alito Quartz</div>
  <div class="section-title reveal">Built to last.<br><em>Engineered to</em><br>impress.</div>

  <div class="why-grid">
    <div class="why-card reveal">
      <div class="why-icon-wrap">✦</div>
      <div class="why-card-title">Fully Antimicrobial</div>
      <div class="why-card-text">Alito Quartz uses Ultra Fresh® technology — 24/7 protection against bacteria, mould and mildew. Built-in permanently, won't wash off.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card reveal">
      <div class="why-icon-wrap">◈</div>
      <div class="why-card-title">Stain & Scratch Proof</div>
      <div class="why-card-text">Non-porous surface resists stains from spills and foods. Exceptionally scratch-resistant in both flexural and compressive strength.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card reveal">
      <div class="why-icon-wrap">★</div>
      <div class="why-card-title">Fire Performance</div>
      <div class="why-card-text">Classified B1 &mdash; low flammability &mdash; under DIN 4102, the German building-materials fire standard. Tested, documented and suitable for residential and commercial specification.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card reveal">
      <div class="why-icon-wrap">◎</div>
      <div class="why-card-title">10-Year Warranty</div>
      <div class="why-card-text">Every Alito slab carries a 10-year manufacturer's warranty against defects in materials and workmanship (terms apply). Alito holds ISO 9001, ISO 14001, CE and NSF marks.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card reveal">
      <div class="why-icon-wrap">▲</div>
      <div class="why-card-title">Easy Maintenance</div>
      <div class="why-card-text">A simple wipe-down with soap and water is all it takes. Low water absorption means no moisture damage or staining over time.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="why-card reveal">
      <div class="why-icon-wrap">◉</div>
      <div class="why-card-title">Pan-Karnataka Delivery</div>
